          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Milano Moments is a curated space celebrating the women, conversations, celebrations, and everyday luxury that define the Milano community. From intimate book club evenings to personal styling moments, discover how <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/collections/all-products\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/collections/all-products\"><em>fine jewelry</em></a> becomes part of modern life.<br/><br/>Featuring influencers Bruna Petrillo and Monika Clarke styled in <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/collections/best-sellers\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/collections/best-sellers\"><em>Signature Milano Jewelry Classics.</em></a></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
