      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_JXaHAf": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "SPOTTED: MILANO AT ZERO BOND"
          }
        },
        "text_jUByfz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bringing effortless luxury to the evening. We are proud to style the hosts of The Margins book club - Bruna Petrillo and Monika Clarke - for their private events at Zero Bond NYC. These nights blend modern style, literature, and connection, featuring creators who appreciate the versatility of fine jewelry. From signature tennis bracelets to everyday diamond necklaces, Milano serves as the perfect finishing touch to their beautifully curated event.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
